Maintainer: Adriano Rutz <adafede@gmail.com>
Description: CentroidR provides the infrastructure to centroid profile mass
    spectrometry spectra (mzML) with independent MS1 and MS2 tolerances,
    1D Morse-Smale topological prominence valley splitting, weighted
    log-quadratic Gaussian and power-weighted m/z centroiding, overlapping
    multiplet deconvolution, and analyzer-specific m/z domain scaling.
